        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Attribute Name = \"5. Could the AI system cause harms that are irreversible?\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "mediaSingle",
          "attrs": {
            "layout": "align-start"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "media",
              "attrs": {
                "type": "file",
                "id": "d274dff2-bb50-42e8-a042-4e2de14c9523",
                "alt": "image-20250901-002943.png",
                "collection": "",
                "height": 200,
                "width": 479
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Type = “Selection”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Select List = “No; Yes, but it’s better than existing systems; Yes; Unclear”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "panel",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Please use a semicolon “;” to delimit list values"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "attrs": {
            "panelType": "warning"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The dark blue bit also needs to go into the Description:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "“AIAF Slide 32 Significant Harms”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Add at the bottom of Description, add \"Requires Risk” and “Requires Controls\" if present:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "mediaSingle",
          "attrs": {
            "layout": "align-start"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "media",
              "attrs": {
                "type": "file",
                "id": "3d133b50-57a3-4148-86f0-1f3e62ea1a46",
                "alt": "image-20250901-002831.png",
                "collection": "",
                "height": 37,
                "width": 360
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Infer the type of Risk from the question, and append to “Requires Risk: <Risk Type>”."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "As JSON does not support line break characters, use HTML <br> for line breaks where present."
            },
            {
              "type": "hardBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "hardBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The complete rich-text Description would be:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "panel",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "1 Community Benefit"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "IAF Slide 32 Significant Harms"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Example: Autonomous AI systems on critical infrastructure (i.e. energy)"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "For more information on when a Human Rights Impact Assessment is required see:"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "https://humanrights.gov.au/",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://humanrights.gov.au/"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Requires Explanation"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Requires Risk: AI system causes harms that are irreversible"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Requires Controls"
                },
